  "text": "proprium.dedicatio-sancti-michaelis-archangeli-introitus",
  "about": "The introitus of the formulary “Dedication of Saint Michael the Archangel” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Bless the Lord, all His Angels, you mighty in strength, who carry out His command, hearkening to the voice of His words. Bless the Lord, O my soul, and all that is within me, bless His holy name. Glory be to the Father, and to the Son, and to the Holy Ghost. As it was in the beginning, is now, and ever shall be, world without end. Amen. Bless the Lord, all His Angels, you mighty in strength, who carry out His command, hearkening to the voice of His words." }
  },
